{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23033","main_id":23033,"main_title":"《召唤王》","main_description":"在须弥，你遇见了一个正在取材的小说家…","chapter_title":"《召唤王》","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2303306,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2303306,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":230330607,"next_line_ids":[230330608,230330609],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":12717,"speaker_text_hash":2294064624,"speaker":"福本","speaker_raw":"福本","text_hash":1070938042,"text":"这事情说来话长…你听说教令院研发出的卡牌游戏「七圣召唤」吗？","raw_text":"这事情说来话长…你听说教令院研发出的卡牌游戏「七圣召唤」吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2303306.json"}
